    {
      "id": "DEC-005",
      "title": "Retroactively upgrading receipts recorded before this change is deferred. There is no stored judged-line record for them and none can be recovered, so they keep exactly today\u0027s behaviour until re-recorded \u2014 the same posture \u0060.github#2392\u0060 AC5 took for its own legacy bridge. Re-recording is itself a route re-affirmation, which is the correct act for a row whose subject an agent wants re-judged.",
